DESCRIPTION:Online\nAs a former SJN Complicating the Narratives Fellow and
  the director of News Ambassadors\, Shia Levitt is deeply committed to cre
 ating constructive\, solutions-focused reporting around even the most ince
 ndiary issues. While they usually offer depolarization training to newsroo
 ms\, classrooms and leadership cohorts\, Shia and News Ambassadors are hos
 ting a training on April 29 that is open to all. Donations are welcome\, a
 nd all go to News Ambassadors’ work. In the training\, you’ll learn te
 chniques for breaking binaries in your reporting\, listening differently a
 nd deeply\, fighting confirmation bias and more.
LOCATION:Online
URL:https://sojonewsambassadors.org/events/
